uotes":[{"c":"POWI 2025 Q2","e":"powi","d":"2025-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Balu Balakrishnan","x":"Advanced high-voltage semiconductors are essential in EVs, AI data centers, electric rail, and in modern power grids centered on renewable energy, battery storage, and long-distance DC transmission.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/829851629/files/doc_financials/2025/q2/POWI-Q2-2025-Earnings-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"POWI 2025 Q2","e":"powi","d":"2025-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Balu Balakrishnan","x":"This relates to the other recent development in GaN, which is NVIDIA's announcement that it will support an 800-volt DC architecture in the next-generation AI data centers.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/829851629/files/doc_financials/2025/q2/POWI-Q2-2025-Earnings-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"POWI 2025 Q2","e":"powi","d":"2025-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Balu Balakrishnan","x":"While our core consumer appliance business faces short-term headwinds due to tariffs and stagnant housing markets, we remain bullish on the long-term opportunity.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/829851629/files/doc_financials/2025/q2/POWI-Q2-2025-Earnings-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"POWI 2025 Q2","e":"powi","d":"2025-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Balu Balakrishnan","x":"Orders have slowed in recent weeks, likely reflecting customer caution around constantly changing tariff headlines.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/829851629/files/doc_financials/2025/q2/POWI-Q2-2025-Earnings-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"POWI 2025 Q3","e":"powi","d":"2025-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Lloyd","x":"At last month's OCP Global Summit, we published a paper demonstrating the advantages of our 1,250 and 1,700-volt GaN technologies in 800-volt DC AI data centers.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/829851629/files/doc_financials/2025/q3/POWI-Q3-2025-Earnings-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"POWI 2025 Q3","e":"powi","d":"2025-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Lloyd","x":"While we're excited about the 800-volt opportunity, GaN can also bring significant improvements in power density to existing AI data center architectures, which are expected to remain prevalent for years to come.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/829851629/files/doc_financials/2025/q3/POWI-Q3-2025-Earnings-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"POWI 2025 Q3","e":"powi","d":"2025-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Lloyd","x":"Throughout the year, we have called out the sensitivity of white goods and other appliances to tariffs owing to their high dollar value and their steel content.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/829851629/files/doc_financials/2025/q3/POWI-Q3-2025-Earnings-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"POWI 2025 Q3","e":"powi","d":"2025-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Lloyd","x":"But tariffs have severely disrupted that industry, adding to the difficulties caused by stagnant home sales in the US and China's weak housing market.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/829851629/files/doc_financials/2025/q3/POWI-Q3-2025-Earnings-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"POWI 2025 Q4","e":"powi","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Joe Shiffler","x":"These and other upcoming products will enable us to sustain and grow our core IC business even as we shift our investment priorities towards markets like AI data center, industrial, and automotive where our expertise is helping customers solve their toughest power challenges.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/829851629/files/doc_financials/2025/q4/POWI-Q4-2025-Earnings-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"POWI 2025 Q4","e":"powi","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Nancy Erba","x":"Our technology is creating increasing value for our customers and giving us access to expanding new markets like automotive and AI data center.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/829851629/files/doc_financials/2025/q4/POWI-Q4-2025-Earnings-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"POWI 2025 Q4","e":"powi","d":"2026-02-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joe Shiffler","x":"Looking at recent business trends, booking improved significantly in Q4 after slowing in the prior quarter, partly as a result of excess appliance inventory shipped into the US last year ahead of the tariffs.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/829851629/files/doc_financials/2025/q4/POWI-Q4-2025-Earnings-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"POWI 2025 Q4","e":"powi","d":"2026-02-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joe Shiffler","x":"The effective tariffs on appliance prices and ongoing softness in China housing.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/829851629/files/doc_financials/2025/q4/POWI-Q4-2025-Earnings-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"POWI 2025 Q4","e":"powi","d":"2026-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Shiffler","x":"We are announcing today that we carried out a restructuring earlier this week, reducing our global workforce by about 7%.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/829851629/files/doc_financials/2025/q4/POWI-Q4-2025-Earnings-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"POWI 2025 Q4","e":"powi","d":"2026-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Shiffler","x":"We are streamlining our R&D pipeline to focus on delivering our highest priority and highest value products in time to intersect the market.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/829851629/files/doc_financials/2025/q4/POWI-Q4-2025-Earnings-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"POWI 2026 Q1","e":"powi","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Lloyd","x":"Even as we pivot toward the AI data center, industrial and automotive markets, we are refreshing these existing product families to sustain and grow core markets like appliances, where reliability and efficiency are highly valued, and dollar content is rising along with appliance power levels.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/829851629/files/doc_financials/2026/q1/POWI-Q1-2026-Earnings-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"POWI 2026 Q1","e":"powi","d":"2026-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Lloyd","x":"Consumer revenue was down compared to the first quarter of 2025, which was unusually strong due to tariff-related pull-ins in appliances.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/829851629/files/doc_financials/2026/q1/POWI-Q1-2026-Earnings-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"POWI 2026 Q1","e":"powi","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Shiffler","x":"NonGAAP income-statement measures in the first quarter exclude stock-based compensation expenses, amortization of acquisition-related intangible assets, restructuring charges, and the tax effects of these items.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/829851629/files/doc_financials/2026/q1/POWI-Q1-2026-Earnings-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"POWI 2026 Q1","e":"powi","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Lloyd","x":"Just as importantly, we are making good progress on our strategic focus areas: Customer-centricity Streamlining our product pipeline for time to market; and Operational and organizational efficiency Firstly, we are improving alignment between our commercial and engineering teams to bring the…","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/829851629/files/doc_financials/2026/q1/POWI-Q1-2026-Earnings-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"POWI 2026 Q2","e":"powi","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Joe Shiffler","x":"Higher voltages are an important trend not just in the context of data centers, but across the entire power ecosystem that will support AI infrastructure as well as electric vehicles and the modernization of power grids around the world.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/829851629/files/doc_financials/2026/q2/POWI-Q2-2026-Earnings-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"POWI 2026 Q2","e":"powi","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Joe Shiffler","x":"Energy storage is becoming a foundational element of renewable energy systems, industrial power infrastructure, and power for AI data centers.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/829851629/files/doc_financials/2026/q2/POWI-Q2-2026-Earnings-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"POWI 2026 Q2","e":"powi","d":"2026-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Shiffler","x":"Non-GAAP income statement measures exclude stock-based compensation expenses, amortization of acquisition-related intangible assets, accrual for a judgment in a legal matter, a restructuring charge recognized in the first quarter of 2026, and the tax effects of these items.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/829851629/files/doc_financials/2026/q2/POWI-Q2-2026-Earnings-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"POWI 2026 Q2","e":"powi","d":"2026-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Shiffler","x":"We continue to align expenses more closely with revenue through the restructuring we completed in Q1 and a broader set of efficiency and spending discipline initiatives.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/829851629/files/doc_financials/2026/q2/POWI-Q2-2026-Earnings-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"POWI 2026 Q3","e":"powi","d":"2026-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Lloyd","x":"In the consumer market, which makes up 1/3 of our sales, demand continues to be soft due largely to stagnant housing markets and higher prices for appliances driven by tariffs and rising raw material costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/powerint-powi-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"POWI 2026 Q3","e":"powi","d":"2026-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Christopher Rolland","x":"And secondly, do you think this has anything to do with the channel build, maybe the channel getting these parts because they are available in front of either expanding lead times or price hikes like they've seen from other partners?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/powerint-powi-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"POWI 2026 Q3","e":"powi","d":"2026-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Joe Shiffler","x":"Non-GAAP income statement measures exclude stock-based compensation expenses, amortization of acquisition-related intangible assets, accruals for a judgment in a legal matter, restructuring charge recognized in the first quarte